🔑 Core System Root Container: Displays only file names inside the file manager tree. You can safely read and review contents for debugging purposes, but any system-level write, edit, or overwrite actions are entirely blocked by the kernel to prevent breakage.📂 User Section Container: Unlocks full Read/Write control over the workspace, giving you freedom to add, edit, or delete personal tools, generated media, and custom app packages